## Design system — Harbor (shared with the other two apps)

This app is one of three sibling apps (Coifish, ReelMinder, PacketSkipper) that must look like one product family. The design language lives in the `@longline/harbor` package (the `harbor` repo next to this one), not in this repo. Read `HARBOR.md` in that package before any UI work, `components.md` before building or changing a component, `app-shell.md` for the signed-in layout, and `site.md` for the marketing site. This app is **APP_NAME**; its accent is `--APP_ACCENT`.

Rules that are not negotiable:
- Never create a local copy of anything Harbor provides: no `harbor/` folder in this repo, no local Dock, Mark, StatusBadge, ThemeSwitch or FamilySection, no copied logo files. Import them from `@longline/harbor`. If something is missing from the package, add it to the package (on a branch, with a changelog entry and a version bump), then use it here.
- All colors, spacing, radii and type come from the package's `tokens.css` custom properties. Never hardcode a hex, px radius or font-family in component code.
- This app's accent is `--APP_ACCENT` (and `--APP_ACCENT-deep` for text). It is used only for the app's mark, the active Dock tile and the app-bar underline. Buttons, links, focus rings and navigation use `--sea`.
- Surfaces separate with `--hairline` borders, never shadows. No gradients. No emoji in UI copy.
- Fonts: Fraunces for display styles, Instrument Sans for UI, IBM Plex Mono for dates, amounts and IDs. Do not substitute Inter/Roboto/system fonts.
- Spell the product names exactly: Coifish, ReelMinder, PacketSkipper (never lowercase, never COIFish). The company name comes from `company` in the package; never type it by hand.
- Light and dark themes both ship. A page follows the device's setting (tokens.css does this) until the person uses the `ThemeSwitch`; the choice is then `[data-theme]` on `<html>`, applied before first paint with `themeChoiceScript()` from the package.
- The marketing site follows `site.md` section for section; only the mark, accent, copy and mockup content differ from the other two sites.
- When in doubt about a visual decision, follow the package's `HARBOR.md` over existing code in this repo.
- Do not change the Harbor package during an unattended run. Note what it needs in the report instead.

Replace APP_NAME / APP_ACCENT: Coifish / koi, ReelMinder / brass, PacketSkipper / kelp.
